# P2.15 three-way parity replay trace: Arena, one human + one drone.
#
# This schedule is expressed with release-authorized ops only (drive, driveabs,
# turn, aim, fire, firehold, wep) so the exact same command log can be driven
# through the frozen-X legacy controls, the direct intent queue and the real
# codec/ENet/session network admission path.  Player 0 is the human; the drone
# (player 1) is autonomous and is never commanded.
#
# Fields: <tick> <player> <op> [args]
1 0 turn 0
1 0 drive 9
30 0 aim 1500 1500
30 0 wep 0 on
31 0 wep 1 on
32 0 firehold on
180 0 drive -6
360 0 aim 800 1500
520 0 drive 9
